<p><span style="font-size: inherit;">Thank you for registering as an&nbsp;external reviewer for Wadhwani Innovation Network (WIN). We are delighted to have you as a part of our mission to accelerate innovation and research.&nbsp;</span></p><p>As part of the next steps, you will shortly receive a <strong>Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA)</strong> at your registered email address. This is to ensure that all research-related data shared with you remains strictly confidential, in line with our commitment to data privacy and ethical review processes.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span data-teams="true"></span></p><p>We look forward to your active engagement and valuable insights in evaluating high-impact R&amp;D proposals.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

